WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:37.930 --> 01:42.260
Well now, you seem to have
broken my mask very thoroughly...

01:42.260 --> 01:43.200
Who are you?!

01:43.630 --> 01:47.600
Why do you have the same face as Mubyo?

01:47.600 --> 01:48.530
It's the other way around.

01:48.970 --> 01:51.530
That thing has the same face as me.

01:52.610 --> 01:54.700
I see how it is... Geez.

01:57.180 --> 02:02.140
Our Fox Deity, Betrays?!

02:06.090 --> 02:08.580
Where did you lose your contacts?

02:08.820 --> 02:10.120
Further up ahead.

02:13.030 --> 02:15.800
Mubyo-chan, do you even wear contacts?

02:15.800 --> 02:16.700
Yes.

02:17.500 --> 02:20.660
What kind are they? Soft or hard?

02:21.870 --> 02:23.870
How bad is your eyesight?

02:23.870 --> 02:25.640
What brand are they?

02:25.640 --> 02:27.410
Where did you buy them?

02:27.410 --> 02:28.740
I don't know.

02:29.240 --> 02:33.270
I don't wear contacts. You already know that.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.510
Oh.

02:44.790 --> 02:48.590
Are we just going to keep walking?

02:54.240 --> 02:56.540
I'm going to show him up...

02:56.540 --> 03:00.840
I'll prove I'm no longer just a puppet...

03:01.180 --> 03:02.300
To who?

03:02.680 --> 03:04.580
To the guy wearing the owl mask.

03:04.680 --> 03:06.580
Why do you want to show him up?

03:06.880 --> 03:08.280
Because I hate him!

03:12.990 --> 03:15.010
What are you going to do from now on?

03:15.290 --> 03:17.530
I said I'm going to show him up!

03:17.530 --> 03:18.960
By using that fox.

03:19.990 --> 03:20.980
You mean Ku-chan?

03:24.200 --> 03:29.230
That fox wouldn't hesitate to
kill a god if it's to protect you.

03:30.510 --> 03:34.500
I'll take you as my hostage and
make the fox attack owl face.

03:34.780 --> 03:37.240
But they're already fighting.

03:37.910 --> 03:41.350
That's not a fight. It's all part of his plan.

03:41.950 --> 03:49.790
At the time of her creation, I programmed
her to come to my aid if I was in any danger.

03:50.060 --> 03:52.620
You've been a huge pain in the ass, you know?

03:53.090 --> 03:56.090
All this just to lure Mubyo here...

03:56.400 --> 04:00.090
So you used me...

04:00.440 --> 04:03.100
If you put it that way, yes.

04:03.400 --> 04:05.870
I do apologize for that.

04:06.740 --> 04:11.580
At any rate, I succeeded in luring her out...

04:12.280 --> 04:12.940
But...

04:13.150 --> 04:13.880
But what?

04:16.020 --> 04:17.210
She got away.

04:18.790 --> 04:22.690
You want Ku-chan and
Fukuro-san to kill each other?!

04:22.860 --> 04:23.490
Yes.

04:23.490 --> 04:26.760
It's not right to get someone else to do it for you!

04:26.760 --> 04:31.860
You're strong, Mubyo-chan!
If you hate him that much, do it yourself!

04:33.100 --> 04:36.440
I can't hurt Fukuro.

04:36.440 --> 04:37.670
Why?!

04:39.470 --> 04:40.570
Because I love him.

04:43.510 --> 04:45.710
I thought you hated him.

04:46.010 --> 04:46.880
I do hate him.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.240
But you just said you love him.

04:49.980 --> 04:53.680
I do love him. But I hate him because I love him.

04:54.660 --> 04:59.150
Then why do you want to kill Fukuro-san?

05:00.190 --> 05:02.360
That's just how I am.

05:02.700 --> 05:04.290
What do you mean?

05:04.370 --> 05:09.560
Yes... I'm a creature meant
only to serve... only to love.

05:10.410 --> 05:16.070
The only way I can get his attention is to rebel...

05:17.210 --> 05:18.910
That's just how I am.

05:20.850 --> 05:22.370
No. That's not right.

05:22.920 --> 05:26.610
To him, I'm not even considered a living thing.

05:30.560 --> 05:32.960
Maybe we should go walk some more.

05:33.290 --> 05:35.460
What do you mean she got away?

05:37.030 --> 05:41.140
All that trouble for nothing. Serves you right.

05:41.140 --> 05:44.130
This might be a bad time to say this, but...

05:44.870 --> 05:49.240
It seems Toru-kun is also gone...

05:49.410 --> 05:50.470
What?!

05:50.880 --> 05:55.650
She didn't even come see me and
took Toru-kun off to somewhere.

05:55.650 --> 05:58.950
Why didn't you tell me something
that important earlier?! You idiot!

06:08.830 --> 06:10.800
Hey, it moved!

06:13.330 --> 06:15.500
Wait, that's not yours...

06:15.500 --> 06:18.500
I'm just borrowing it from one of my worshipers.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.540
Hey, wait!

06:35.860 --> 06:37.720
Ish purdy!

06:47.440 --> 06:49.700
Purrrdy!

06:49.700 --> 06:52.910
She's lighting so many at once. What a waste...

06:52.910 --> 06:56.740
I'm surprised to find out
Ko-san can loosen up like that.

06:56.740 --> 07:00.370
That's not it! She's drunk!

07:02.280 --> 07:06.050
Ish shtarting to feel warrrm...

07:08.220 --> 07:09.190
Really?!

07:10.120 --> 07:11.990
K-Ko-chan, no!

07:12.190 --> 07:13.900
Why am I getting this?

07:13.900 --> 07:16.830
Because I said so! Don't look!

07:17.030 --> 07:20.030
Wait! Wait! No!

07:20.030 --> 07:21.130
Now what?!

07:21.400 --> 07:23.730
It came off!

07:25.010 --> 07:26.700
D-Did it?!

07:27.640 --> 07:28.400
Really?!

07:28.910 --> 07:30.980
H-H-Her b!

07:30.980 --> 07:32.350
- No! Don't look!

07:32.350 --> 07:33.470
- You're hurting me!
- No! Don't look!

07:33.550 --> 07:36.710
Your nails! Your nails are digging into my eyes!

07:37.220 --> 07:38.780
Wait!

07:40.960 --> 07:42.350
Ko-chan, where are you going?

07:42.820 --> 07:44.790
Wait!

07:45.360 --> 07:47.620
Oh, geez...

07:48.400 --> 07:49.560
I'm going, too...

07:53.970 --> 07:56.130
Why now?!

08:00.910 --> 08:06.540
I'll be alone with Takagami while
we're going after Ko-chan...

08:09.420 --> 08:11.410
Don't mess up, Misaki!

08:13.090 --> 08:14.180
Hey, Sakura...

08:25.070 --> 08:26.930
Let me give you an example...

08:27.800 --> 08:30.600
Let's say you got 100 points on a test, Toru-chan.

08:31.470 --> 08:33.870
That's a result of you studying really hard.

08:35.040 --> 08:35.940
Uh-huh.

08:36.080 --> 08:40.980
You then took it home and
showed it to your mother.

08:41.720 --> 08:46.520
She compliments you on a job well done.

08:47.220 --> 08:48.450
Doesn't that make you happy?

08:54.730 --> 08:55.490
Yeah.

08:56.360 --> 09:01.560
Well... that one little compliment is all I want.

09:02.170 --> 09:04.970
Is that too much to ask?

09:05.970 --> 09:08.070
You want Fukuro-san to give you a compliment?

09:08.710 --> 09:11.700
I thought he would...

09:14.050 --> 09:15.570
But he got mad instead.

09:16.320 --> 09:19.950
He said I couldn't be trusted with
the Sakasaen! The nerve of him!

09:22.190 --> 09:25.750
I guarded the Sakasaen all this time.

09:26.390 --> 09:28.030
All because he ordered me to.

09:28.030 --> 09:32.130
I tried so hard, but after that one little mistake...

09:33.830 --> 09:35.100
Mubyo-chan...

09:35.840 --> 09:37.740
He never does anything for me...

09:37.740 --> 09:39.570
He never says anything to me...

09:40.980 --> 09:46.170
If he won't accept me no matter what I do,
I have no reason to exist.

09:52.290 --> 09:53.910
What am I supposed to do?

09:55.560 --> 09:57.890
My existence has no meaning,
but I can't do anything but stay here?

10:00.160 --> 10:01.590
Stay away!

10:10.140 --> 10:13.630
Unless you want to see Toru-chan dead,
go and kill Fukuro.

10:20.750 --> 10:22.810
You have a grudge on Fukuro?

10:23.180 --> 10:25.490
When did I allow you to ask questions?

10:25.490 --> 10:29.090
Just do it and bring me Fukuro's corpse.

10:29.090 --> 10:30.260
Mubyo-chan!

10:30.260 --> 10:31.390
I'm serious!

10:31.390 --> 10:35.990
If Fukuro-san dies, you're the
one that'll be hurt the most!

10:37.100 --> 10:38.900
He won't die...

10:39.130 --> 10:43.140
If he fights seriously,
even a tenko won't stand a chance.

10:43.140 --> 10:43.940
But...

10:43.940 --> 10:48.670
He will only look at me through a
fight to the death with the tenko.

10:48.780 --> 10:49.900
But...

10:50.510 --> 10:51.480
Go.

10:51.910 --> 10:55.910
If you refuse, I will turn your precious
Toru-chan into ash with the Sakasaen.

11:05.130 --> 11:06.590
Go ahead.

11:06.960 --> 11:07.960
Ku-chan?

11:07.960 --> 11:09.020
What did you say?

11:09.460 --> 11:11.260
I said go ahead.

11:11.670 --> 11:13.960
If you want to turn Toru into ash,
just go ahead and do it!

11:14.300 --> 11:16.600
What are you saying? Are you for real?

11:16.600 --> 11:17.590
Of course.

11:18.270 --> 11:21.970
That's what you get for following
her without thinking ahead.

11:23.680 --> 11:28.340
Why? Why doesn't anything
turn out the way I want?

11:29.250 --> 11:31.490
Why does everything always backfire?

11:31.490 --> 11:35.920
The fox... with him... with me...

11:39.660 --> 11:41.060
You'll regret this!

12:10.160 --> 12:11.020
Toru!

12:12.090 --> 12:12.890
Toru!

12:13.560 --> 12:14.460
Y-Yes?

12:15.160 --> 12:16.250
Do you have any burns on you?

12:16.430 --> 12:18.130
I'm fine.

12:37.620 --> 12:40.140
You're pretty cruel, you know that?

12:41.790 --> 12:44.450
Why did Mubyo-chan?

12:47.500 --> 12:51.560
I cast the spell of Mirror Reflect on this earlier.

12:51.770 --> 12:54.070
The color's different now...

12:54.070 --> 12:59.230
The spell vanishes after one use.
But in exchange, it'll work on anything.

13:02.480 --> 13:05.210
I'm sorry I let you out of my sight.

13:05.310 --> 13:09.050
No, it's okay. I'm fine.

13:09.050 --> 13:09.820
Good.

13:09.820 --> 13:11.480
But Mubyo-chan is!

13:27.640 --> 13:29.160
What are you staring at?

13:30.570 --> 13:31.830
I'm sorry!

13:37.240 --> 13:39.800
Good hustle.

13:41.720 --> 13:45.280
I can't... let you... get the jump on me.

13:45.590 --> 13:47.110
M-Mubyo-chan?

13:49.360 --> 13:50.980
There's two of you?!

13:51.430 --> 13:55.160
That's not entirely wrong...

13:55.430 --> 13:57.360
I am but another Mubyo.

13:57.870 --> 14:00.100
Actually, I'm THE Mubyo, to be exact.

14:02.170 --> 14:05.170
The Mubyo deity is a nomadic god.

14:05.170 --> 14:07.770
A nomadic god?

14:08.210 --> 14:13.740
It refers to a deity who presides over numerous
lands and rotates their dwelling every few years.

14:13.850 --> 14:17.480
That girl over there stays here...

14:17.480 --> 14:22.660
...representing the presiding deity
while the real Mubyo is in another land.

14:22.660 --> 14:25.590
In other word's she's Mubyo's substitute.

14:25.760 --> 14:27.600
A substitute?

14:27.600 --> 14:29.200
Think of it like a doll.

14:29.200 --> 14:31.660
More like a fake.

14:32.570 --> 14:33.730
But...

14:40.110 --> 14:43.040
Look at you... So pitiful.

14:51.520 --> 14:58.290
Do you know why I broke the
pact to come all the way here?

15:03.460 --> 15:04.870
Presiding deities, well...

15:04.870 --> 15:10.240
We have this agreement where we can't
walk out of our own land without notice.

15:10.500 --> 15:12.530
What happens when they do?

15:12.840 --> 15:16.210
A bunch of really troublesome stuff.

15:16.540 --> 15:23.140
I didn't break the pact or wear this
mask to hide my identity all on a whim.

15:23.880 --> 15:26.750
I did it all to make sure you were safe.

15:27.590 --> 15:31.630
I raised you myself.

15:31.630 --> 15:37.860
I didn't think a mere yokai would
be able to get the better of you.

15:39.270 --> 15:42.290
I knew I shouldn't have come, but here I am.

15:43.000 --> 15:43.900
You're lying.

15:45.070 --> 15:47.940
It's up to you to believe me or not.

15:48.140 --> 15:51.200
It's a fact my coming has complicated matters...

15:51.780 --> 15:53.850
If I knew this would happen, I would never have...

15:53.850 --> 15:57.840
If only you told me that sooner!

16:02.090 --> 16:04.080
There's a cut on your face.

16:04.220 --> 16:06.020
I know.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.020
That's terrible...

16:09.330 --> 16:11.820
You hurt your a beautiful face...

16:14.170 --> 16:18.430
Did it hurt? Does it still hurt? Will this heal?

16:19.010 --> 16:20.570
Will it scar?

16:20.570 --> 16:21.870
It'll heal in no time.

16:23.680 --> 16:27.670
I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

16:28.050 --> 16:31.250
You got this scar because I threw a tantrum.

16:32.490 --> 16:35.940
What should I do?
I didn't know this would happen...

16:36.560 --> 16:40.650
I'm sorry... I'm sorry... Mubyo-sama.

16:41.660 --> 16:43.530
Just be more careful in the future.

16:45.700 --> 16:49.570
Yes... Yes... Yes...

16:53.410 --> 16:55.470
Oh, I get it.

16:56.180 --> 17:00.080
I do love him. I hate him because I love him.

17:01.580 --> 17:07.020
The only way I can get his attention is to rebel...

17:09.060 --> 17:10.680
If only she was more honest with herself.

17:21.400 --> 17:23.070
Wow! A dragon!

17:23.070 --> 17:24.410
That's Mizuchi.

17:24.410 --> 17:25.460
Mizuchi?

17:25.810 --> 17:27.740
The one inside that Mamorime.

17:28.310 --> 17:33.650
But it's supposed to be fused
with the soul of its host...

17:33.650 --> 17:35.810
They shouldn't separate so easily.

17:35.950 --> 17:38.290
Does that mean something happened to Ko-chan?

17:38.290 --> 17:40.050
Wait!

17:43.460 --> 17:47.860
W-Wait!

17:50.030 --> 17:53.020
Why are you running from me?!

17:54.600 --> 17:55.900
I found you guys at the right time!

18:02.680 --> 18:05.610
What?! Ko-chan's drunk?!

18:05.610 --> 18:10.450
Oh, I see. Getting drunk created some gaps
in her soul for it to escape... Or something.

18:10.680 --> 18:13.490
- No! Wait!

18:13.490 --> 18:16.920
- She's so fast!
- No! Wait!

18:17.830 --> 18:20.060
Wait for me!

18:20.060 --> 18:21.220
Noboru!

18:27.840 --> 18:29.130
I-I'm so sorry!

18:35.510 --> 18:37.440
Will you please forgive her?

18:38.250 --> 18:39.340
Of course!

18:39.410 --> 18:42.880
I'd like to see something
solid to prove your sincerity.

18:42.880 --> 18:45.610
I'll bring you a gift sometime later.

18:46.320 --> 18:48.950
But the next time I'll come here will be in 8 years.

18:49.220 --> 18:50.160
What?!

18:50.990 --> 18:56.430
I can't wait for 8 years!

19:00.400 --> 19:02.870
I lost them...

19:03.700 --> 19:06.500
But I won't lose sight of this love of mine!

19:06.910 --> 19:10.240
I'll grab a hold of it one of these days!

19:21.120 --> 19:23.060
Ko-chan, are you okay?

19:23.290 --> 19:25.290
- Welcome home.

19:25.290 --> 19:26.730
- Welcome home.
- Morning!

19:26.730 --> 19:26.760
- Morning!

19:26.760 --> 19:28.250
Mubyo-chan is here!

19:30.360 --> 19:33.390
Please don't shout...

19:34.000 --> 19:35.990
Whoops, sorry. You got a hangover?

19:36.870 --> 19:39.070
What's up, Mubyo-chan?

19:39.310 --> 19:41.870
I wanted to show you these!

19:43.380 --> 19:44.280
Hands!

19:44.280 --> 19:48.380
Yeah! Hands! You know how
my hand puppets burned off yesterday?

19:48.380 --> 19:50.510
Mubyo-sama replaced them for me!

19:51.420 --> 19:53.910
They're like the real thing! Aren't they nice?

19:54.090 --> 19:55.490
I'm happy for you!

19:55.560 --> 19:58.020
Yeah, I'm so happy!

19:58.160 --> 19:59.350
Oh, sorry.

19:59.730 --> 20:04.030
But I have a present for you, Mamorime!

20:04.570 --> 20:08.500
Tadah! I'll give you the Sakasaen!

20:11.910 --> 20:13.170
Are you sure?

20:13.170 --> 20:16.900
A human Mamorime won't be able
to effectively use the Sakasaen.

20:17.340 --> 20:21.110
The Sakasaen has the function of
amplifying her spiritual power.

20:21.110 --> 20:24.880
It'll come in handy when she's protecting Toru-kun.

20:25.320 --> 20:28.910
Or should I have given it to you instead?

20:29.520 --> 20:35.430
Being able to reverse the order of the
Five Phases will make you invincible.

20:35.430 --> 20:37.330
I don't want it.

20:37.330 --> 20:41.630
After all your panicking over
it being stolen, you do this?

20:43.170 --> 20:47.370
I wasn't angry because the Sakasaen was stolen.

20:48.340 --> 20:50.870
I was just worried.

20:51.180 --> 20:55.650
That one can be a bit lazy at times.
She never contacts me...

20:55.650 --> 20:59.350
Well, now. Glad to see how close you two are!

21:00.720 --> 21:05.590
I look forward to seeing Toru-kun
in 8 years when he's all grown up.

21:05.960 --> 21:08.330
Be sure to protect him until then.

21:08.330 --> 21:10.090
I don't need you to tell me.

21:10.230 --> 21:14.200
Ku-chan! Mubyo-chan gave us the Sakasaen!

21:14.200 --> 21:16.030
And her cell number, too!

21:16.500 --> 21:19.700
It'll get much more hectic from here on out.

21:28.350 --> 21:34.810
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:35.290 --> 21:42.530
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:43.860 --> 21:50.360
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:50.500 --> 21:58.140
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

21:59.050 --> 22:06.080
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

22:06.690 --> 22:13.180
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

22:13.390 --> 22:20.830
Daijoubu bokura wa hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:20.830 --> 22:28.480
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:28.480 --> 22:36.120
Daijoubu kanarazu umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:36.120 --> 22:47.360
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:52.970 --> 22:56.090
Man, it's all soggy.

22:56.470 --> 22:59.630
What was the deal with that blackout anyway?

22:59.840 --> 23:02.870
We had to take back so much
stock that it sucked hard.

23:03.010 --> 23:06.880
I'm not gonna let this keep me down.

23:07.150 --> 23:11.350
Construction workers and people from the
electric company will be coming in and out.

23:11.350 --> 23:14.080
It'll help my sales quite a bit.

23:14.290 --> 23:17.690
You sure are pretty resilient.

23:20.290 --> 23:23.260
I'm still taking a loss!

23:25.000 --> 23:25.930
Next Time

23:25.930 --> 23:29.140
Next Time
Effort does not always yield good results.

23:29.140 --> 23:32.140
Next Time
You can try and try again,
only to cause more trouble to others.

23:32.140 --> 23:34.110
Next Time
But that just means I need to work even harder.

23:34.110 --> 23:34.570
Next Time

23:34.570 --> 23:35.110
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work."

23:35.110 --> 23:37.040
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work
Next time, "Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work."

23:37.040 --> 23:37.110
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work

23:37.110 --> 23:39.450
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work
Those who do not work, do not deserve to eat.

23:39.450 --> 23:39.970
Next Time
Our Fox Deity, Goes to Work
